msgstr "切换深色模式"

msgid "Account menu"
msgstr "账户菜单"

msgid "Repository"
msgstr "仓库"

msgid "Permission to submit"
msgstr "提交权限"

msgid "Release"
msgstr "发布版本"

msgid "plugin.json"
msgstr "plugin.json"

msgid "Plugin ID"
msgstr "插件 ID"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

msgid "Packages"
msgstr "安装包"

msgid "License"
msgstr "许可证"

msgid "%{repo} is a public repository."
msgstr "%{repo} 是公开仓库。"

msgid "The repository does not exist or is not public."
msgstr "仓库不存在或未公开。"

msgid "The repository is private. The catalog lists public repositories only."
msgstr "仓库为私有。插件目录只收录公开仓库。"

msgid "This repository may not be listed. Contact the maintainers if you think this is a mistake."
msgstr "此仓库不能上架。如果你认为有误，请联系维护者。"

msgid "The repository is archived."
msgstr "仓库已归档。"

msgid "You installed the Nginx UI Plugin Catalog app on this repository."
msgstr "你在此仓库上安装了 Nginx UI 插件目录应用。"

msgid "You have admin permission on this repository."
msgstr "你在此仓库上拥有 admin 权限。"

msgid "Only an admin of the repository can submit it. Ask an admin to submit it, or to install the Nginx UI Plugin Catalog app."
msgstr "只有仓库管理员可以提交。请让管理员提交，或请管理员安装 Nginx UI 插件目录应用。"

msgid "Version %{version}, the newest stable release."
msgstr "版本 %{version}，最新稳定版本。"

msgid "Version %{version} is a prerelease. The listing starts with it until a stable release is published."
msgstr "版本 %{version} 是预发布版本。在发布稳定版本之前，上架内容以该版本为准。"

msgid "The repository has no GitHub Release with a version tag such as v1.0.0 yet."
msgstr "仓库还没有带版本标签（例如 v1.0.0）的 GitHub Release。"

msgid "Read from the release %{tag}."
msgstr "读取自发布版本 %{tag}。"

msgid "There is no plugin.json at the root of the repository at %{tag}."
msgstr "仓库在 %{tag} 的根目录下没有 plugin.json。"

msgid "plugin.json at %{tag} is not valid JSON."
msgstr "%{tag} 中的 plugin.json 不是有效的 JSON。"

msgid "The plugin ID %{id} does not follow the naming rule, for example io.github.<owner>.<name>."
msgstr "插件 ID %{id} 不符合命名规则，例如 io.github.<所有者>.<名称>。"

msgid "The com.nginxui namespace is reserved for the plugins of the Nginx UI project."
msgstr "com.nginxui 命名空间保留给 Nginx UI 项目自己的插件。"

msgid "The plugin ID %{id} names another GitHub owner than %{owner}."
msgstr "插件 ID %{id} 中的 GitHub 所有者与 %{owner} 不一致。"

msgid "This plugin ID may not be listed. Contact the maintainers if you think this is a mistake."
msgstr "此插件 ID 不能上架。如果你认为有误，请联系维护者。"

msgid "A plugin with this ID is listed already."
msgstr "使用此 ID 的插件已经上架。"

msgid "A submission of this plugin is already under review."
msgstr "此插件已有一个提交正在审核中。"

msgid "plugin.json has no name."
msgstr "plugin.json 没有名称。"

msgid "The name holds \"%{word}\", which no name may hold. Only the plugins of the Nginx UI project are official."
msgstr "名称中包含“%{word}”，任何名称都不能包含它。只有 Nginx UI 项目自己的插件才是官方插件。"

msgid "%{count} packages in the release."
msgstr "发布版本中有 %{count} 个安装包。"

msgid "The release has no package named %{name} or one per platform."
msgstr "发布版本中没有名为 %{name} 的安装包，也没有各平台的安装包。"

msgid "GitHub detects no license in the repository. The listing shows none."
msgstr "GitHub 未在仓库中识别到许可证，上架页面将不显示许可证。"

msgid "Admin"
msgstr "管理员"

msgid "Publisher"
msgstr "发布者"

msgid "Translator"
msgstr "翻译者"

msgid "No access"
msgstr "无权限"

msgid "Everything a publisher can do, plus organization actions such as the partner application and turning community translation on or off."
msgstr "发布者的全部操作，以及组织层面的操作，例如申请成为合作伙伴、开启或关闭社区翻译。"

msgid "Edit store data, manage versions and signers, and run preflight checks."
msgstr "编辑商店资料，管理版本与签名者，运行发布前检查。"

msgid "Edit store texts in every language and review community suggestions."
msgstr "编辑各语言的商店文字，审核社区翻译建议。"

msgid "Official"
msgstr "官方"

msgid "Partner"
msgstr "合作伙伴"

msgid "Community"
msgstr "社区"

msgid "Listed"
msgstr "已上架"

msgid "Draft"
msgstr "草稿"

msgid "Delisted"
msgstr "已下架"

msgid "Submitted"
msgstr "已提交"

msgid "Checks"
msgstr "检查"

msgid "Maintainer review"
msgstr "维护者审核"

msgid "Merged"
msgstr "已合并"

msgid "Live in the catalog"
msgstr "已在目录中上线"

msgid "The plugin is listed in the catalog."
msgstr "插件已在目录中上架。"

msgid "The pull request was closed without merging."
msgstr "拉取请求已关闭，未合并。"

msgid "The checks found problems. Fix them in a new release, then run the checks again."
msgstr "检查发现问题。请在新版本中修复，然后重新运行检查。"

msgid "The checks could not be started. Please try again later."
msgstr "无法启动检查，请稍后重试。"

msgid "The checks could not finish. A maintainer will look into it."
msgstr "检查未能完成，维护者会跟进处理。"

msgid "The packages, signatures and listing are being checked. This takes a few minutes."
msgstr "正在检查安装包、签名和上架信息，需要几分钟。"

msgid "Waiting for a maintainer to review the submission."
msgstr "等待维护者审核。"

msgid "Approved. The plugin appears in the catalog after the next deploy, usually within minutes."
msgstr "已通过审核。插件会在下次部署后出现在目录中，通常只需几分钟。"

msgid "Checks started again"
msgstr "已重新开始检查"

msgid "The checks could not be started"
msgstr "无法启动检查"

msgid "Checks found problems"
msgstr "检查发现问题"

msgid "Checks could not finish"
msgstr "检查未能完成"

msgid "Checks passed, pull request #%{n} opened"
msgstr "检查通过，已创建拉取请求 #%{n}"

msgid "Merged by a maintainer"
msgstr "维护者已合并"

msgid "Pull request closed"
msgstr "拉取请求已关闭"

msgid "Listed in the catalog"
msgstr "已在目录中上架"

msgid "Change not found"
msgstr "未找到该变更"

msgid "New listing"
msgstr "新上架"

msgid "Submitted %{time}"
msgstr "%{time}提交"

msgid "Run the checks again"
msgstr "重新运行检查"

msgid "History"
msgstr "记录"

msgid "Links"
msgstr "链接"

msgid "Pull request #%{n}"
msgstr "拉取请求 #%{n}"

msgid "Log of the checks"
msgstr "检查日志"

msgid "Manage the plugin"
msgstr "管理插件"

msgid "The review is public on GitHub. You are mentioned in the pull request, so GitHub notifies you of comments."
msgstr "审核在 GitHub 上公开进行。拉取请求中提及了你，GitHub 会通知你新的评论。"

msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

msgid "Needs changes"
msgstr "需修改"

msgid "Checking"
msgstr "检查中"

msgid "In review"
msgstr "审核中"

msgid "Publishing"
msgstr "发布中"

msgid "Manage the plugins you list in the catalog and follow changes under review."
msgstr "管理你在插件目录中上架的插件，跟进审核中的变更。"

msgid "Your plugins could not be loaded."
msgstr "无法加载你的插件。"

msgid "Retry"
msgstr "重试"

msgid "In progress"
msgstr "进行中"

msgid "View"
msgstr "查看"

msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "插件"

msgid "Filter by owner"
msgstr "按所有者筛选"

msgid "You have no role on any listed plugin yet."
msgstr "你还没有任何已上架插件的角色。"

msgid "Plugins appear here when you have admin, maintain, write or triage permission on their repository."
msgstr "你在插件仓库上拥有 admin、maintain、write 或 triage 权限时，插件会显示在这里。"

msgid "Repositories you can submit"
msgstr "可提交的仓库"

msgid "Public repositories you administer or installed the Nginx UI Plugin Catalog app on. With the app installed, new releases reach the catalog within minutes."
msgstr "你管理的公开仓库，以及你安装了 Nginx UI 插件目录应用的仓库。安装应用后，新版本会在几分钟内同步到目录。"

msgid "No repository is waiting to be submitted."
msgstr "暂无可提交的仓库。"

msgid "App installed %{time}"
msgstr "%{time}安装应用"

msgid "You administer this repository"
msgstr "你是此仓库的管理员"

msgid "Submit as plugin"
msgstr "提交为插件"

msgid "Install the app on another repository"
msgstr "在其他仓库上安装应用"

msgid "Page not found"
msgstr "页面不存在"

msgid "The page you are looking for does not exist."
msgstr "你访问的页面不存在。"

msgid "Back to my plugins"
msgstr "返回我的插件"

msgid "The accounts and organizations that own the plugins you work on. Names, avatars and members come from GitHub."
msgstr "你参与的插件所属的个人账号与组织。名称、头像与成员均来自 GitHub。"

msgid "The organizations could not be loaded."
msgstr "无法加载组织。"

msgid "GitHub organization"
msgstr "GitHub 组织"

msgid "Personal account"
msgstr "个人账号"

msgid "%{n} plugin"
msgid_plural "%{n} plugins"
msgstr[0] "%{n} 个插件"

msgid "Open"
msgstr "打开"

msgid "Organization not found"
msgstr "未找到该组织"

msgid "You have no role on any plugin of this account."
msgstr "你在该账号的插件上没有任何角色。"

msgid "Name, avatar and members come from GitHub"
msgstr "名称、头像与成员均来自 GitHub"

msgid "View organization on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上查看组织"

msgid "View account on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上查看账号"

msgid "Plugins of this account you have a role on. Each role follows your permission on that repository."
msgstr "该账号下你拥有角色的插件，角色按你在各仓库上的权限显示。"

msgid "Members and access"
msgstr "成员与权限"

msgid "Members and permissions are managed on GitHub. The Developer Center decides what each person may do from their repository permission."
msgstr "成员与权限在 GitHub 上管理，开发者中心按仓库权限决定每个人能做什么。"

msgid "Manage teams and repository access on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上管理团队与仓库权限"

msgid "Your access"
msgstr "你的权限"

msgid "Read from GitHub %{time}"
msgstr "%{time}从 GitHub 读取"

msgid "From your %{permission} permission on %{repo}"
msgstr "来自你在 %{repo} 上的 %{permission} 权限"

msgid "You can view this plugin as a maintainer."
msgstr "你以维护者身份查看此插件。"

msgid "Manage access on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上管理访问权限"

msgid "Roles"
msgstr "角色对应"

msgid "The Developer Center keeps no separate members or roles"
msgstr "开发者中心不单独设置成员与角色"

msgid "Repository permission on GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub 仓库权限"

msgid "Role"
msgstr "开发者中心角色"

msgid "What it allows"
msgstr "可以做的事"

msgid "When someone loses their permission on GitHub, their role in the Developer Center ends with it."
msgstr "在 GitHub 上移除某人的权限后，对方在开发者中心的角色随即失效。"

msgid "Owner"
msgstr "所有者"

msgid "The owner is the owner of the repository. When the repository moves to another owner on GitHub, the plugin moves with it after review."
msgstr "所有者就是仓库的所有者。仓库在 GitHub 上转移给其他所有者后，插件会在审核后随之转移。"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

msgid "Access"
msgstr "访问权限"

msgid "You have no access to this plugin"
msgstr "你没有此插件的访问权限"

msgid "Access follows your permission on the plugin repository on GitHub."
msgstr "访问权限取决于你在 GitHub 插件仓库上的权限。"

msgid "Plugin not found"
msgstr "未找到插件"

msgid "No listing or draft has this plugin ID."
msgstr "没有使用此插件 ID 的上架内容或草稿。"

msgid "View in catalog"
msgstr "在目录中查看"

msgid "Plugin sections"
msgstr "插件页面"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

msgid "Released"
msgstr "发布日期"

msgid "Requires Nginx UI"
msgstr "所需 Nginx UI 版本"

msgid "Release notes"
msgstr "发布说明"

msgid "Listing"
msgstr "上架信息"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

msgid "Categories"
msgstr "分类"

msgid "Latest version"
msgstr "最新版本"

msgid "Versions"
msgstr "版本"

msgid "Sign in was cancelled on GitHub."
msgstr "已在 GitHub 上取消登录。"

msgid "The sign in request has expired. Please try again."
msgstr "登录请求已过期，请重试。"

msgid "GitHub could not complete the sign in. Please try again later."
msgstr "GitHub 未能完成登录，请稍后重试。"

msgid "Submit plugins"
msgstr "提交插件"

msgid "Choose a repository and the release and plugin details are read for you. Preview the listing before you submit."
msgstr "选择仓库后自动读取版本与插件信息，提交前即可预览上架效果。"

msgid "Manage on your own"
msgstr "自助管理"

msgid "Yank versions, revoke signers and change categories. Saved changes take effect immediately."
msgstr "撤回版本、撤销签名者、调整分类，保存后立即生效。"

msgid "Public review"
msgstr "公开审核"

msgid "New listings and key changes are reviewed by maintainers, and every review is public."
msgstr "新上架与关键信息变更由维护者审核，审核记录公开可查。"

msgid "Nginx UI Developer Center"
msgstr "Nginx UI 开发者中心"

msgid "Submit plugins, manage your listings and follow their review."
msgstr "提交插件，管理上架内容，查看审核进度。"

msgid "Sign in with GitHub"
msgstr "使用 GitHub 登录"

msgid "Signing in only confirms your GitHub identity. It grants no write access to your repositories."
msgstr "登录仅用于确认你的 GitHub 身份，不会获得你仓库的写入权限。"

msgid "The primary public key is not a minisign public key. Paste the content of primary.pub."
msgstr "主公钥不是 minisign 公钥，请粘贴 primary.pub 的内容。"

msgid "The checks no longer pass. Check the repository again."
msgstr "检查已不再通过，请重新检查仓库。"

msgid "The submission could not be sent. Please try again."
msgstr "提交失败，请重试。"

msgid "Once the checks pass, submit the plugin. It is listed after a maintainer approves it."
msgstr "检查通过后提交，维护者审核通过即在目录中上架。"

msgid "owner/repository"
msgstr "所有者/仓库"

msgid "Check"
msgstr "检查"

msgid "You need admin permission on the repository. The newest release, its plugin.json and its packages are read from GitHub."
msgstr "你需要拥有仓库的 admin 权限。最新版本、其中的 plugin.json 和安装包会从 GitHub 读取。"

msgid "The repository could not be checked. Please try again."
msgstr "无法检查该仓库，请重试。"

msgid "Name translations"
msgstr "名称翻译"

msgid "Names in every language are reviewed with the submission."
msgstr "各语言的名称会随提交一起审核。"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "提交信息"

msgid "Primary public key"
msgstr "主公钥"

msgid "The content of primary.pub, created with nginx-ui plugin key init. It verifies the signer certificates of your releases."
msgstr "使用 nginx-ui plugin key init 生成的 primary.pub 的内容，用于验证你发布版本的签名者证书。"

msgid "Up to three. Suggested from the capabilities of the plugin."
msgstr "最多三个，根据插件的能力推荐。"

msgid "Submit for review"
msgstr "提交审核"

msgid "Passed"
msgstr "已通过"

msgid "After you submit, the packages, their signatures and the signer certificate are verified in the catalog repository."
msgstr "提交后，插件目录仓库会校验安装包、签名和签名者证书。"

